        "TileImage": "$($repository a5c4a3e8-40d6-497b-a688-c65611161cba).Image",
        "Description": "A contract has been issued. MATTHEW NIMETH is undercover at a miami race attempting to find one of our rogue agents using the codename ROSE-LILLY he must be eliminated with the one thing we can provide you, a poison needle. CASIMIRO COOKSON has been turned but is now a lose end deal with him.\rOne of the drivers at this race has infomation regarding ROSE-LILLY&apos;s location. Kill two of her mechanics to help us extort it from her.\r\rThe Sisters Of Freedom will not accept failure.",
